(7221534, 1113486, 128323, '<td valign="top">Very nice... Living in a large city, I can rarely get a clear day, so sometimes you have to make the smog work for you, which you did brilliantly here.  Beautiful!</td>', 'Very nice... Living in a large city, I can rarely get a clear day, so sometimes you have to make the smog work for you, which you did brilliantly here.  Beautiful!', '2014-05-28 08:58:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7221535, 1114037, 128323, '<td valign="top">This is gorgeous!  Great perspective and colors.</td>', 'This is gorgeous!  Great perspective and colors.', '2014-05-28 08:59:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7221553, 1114308, 174999, '<td valign="top">love the curves in this, the only guy makes things stand out more bringing punch to this photo..very well done</td>', 'love the curves in this, the only guy makes things stand out more bringing punch to this photo..very well done', '2014-05-28 09:45:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7221554, 1114161, 174999, '<td valign="top">One of the main bridges I would love to see in person ( a bucket list for me) I usually see tons of side views, but rarely no views like this. Not sure on how you did this without getting ran over, but I really like this shot instead of the side views. Great choice for this challenge 10!</td>', 'One of the main bridges I would love to see in person ( a bucket list for me) I usually see tons of side views, but rarely no views like this. Not sure on how you did this without getting ran over, but I really like this shot instead of the side views. Great choice for this challenge 10!', '2014-05-28 09:47:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7221558, 1114270, 174999, '<td valign="top">I so love castles.. so lucky to live one near you.. have you ever been in side one? I would love to see pictures if you have.<br/> <br/>Very awesome!</td>', 'I so love castles.. so lucky to live one near you.. have you ever been in side one? I would love to see pictures if you have. Very awesome!', '2014-05-28 10:10:37.000000', NULL, 1),
