(7222172, 1114456, 163430, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. B&amp;W surely works here.<br/>All this glass and still managed not to include yourself in the frame.</td>', 'Nicely done. B&W surely works here.All this glass and still managed not to include yourself in the frame.', '2014-05-29 12:30:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7222178, 1114254, 61396, '<td valign="top">great title too!</td>', 'great title too!', '2014-05-29 12:47:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7222188, 1114130, 163430, '<td valign="top">Very nice idea. <br/>Too bad the execution is missing some final touches (some of the courtesy of minimal editing). The car on the right and the roof part on the left do not belong to the image. The highlights in the sky and on parts of the grass are blown. The image looks slightly tilted to the right (according to the roof, not the horizon).<br/> <br/>I am not sure whether B&amp;W works for this image, also. If i was to shoot this scene in B&amp;W, in minimal editing, i would have boosted the contrast in the JPG profile and maybe the sharpness too.</td>', 'Very nice idea. Too bad the execution is missing some final touches (some of the courtesy of minimal editing). The car on the right and the roof part on the left do not belong to the image. The highlights in the sky and on parts of the grass are blown. The image looks slightly tilted to the right (according to the roof, not the horizon). I am not sure whether B&W works for this image, also. If i was to shoot this scene in B&W, in minimal editing, i would have boosted the contrast in the JPG profile and maybe the sharpness too.', '2014-05-29 13:06:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7222191, 1114273, 163430, '<td valign="top">+1 for the caption.</td>', '+1 for the caption.', '2014-05-29 13:07:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7222193, 1114054, 163081, '<td valign="top">Most of the pictures I will only watch few second and vote, but this one keeps me looking fascinating to it few a long time. Higher votes for this one.</td>', 'Most of the pictures I will only watch few second and vote, but this one keeps me looking fascinating to it few a long time. Higher votes for this one.', '2014-05-29 13:09:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7222195, 1114285, 163081, '<td valign="top">Been there. and visited some of those amazing Nuraghe''s. Love the colours of your shot. vivid and sharp.</td>', 'Been there. and visited some of those amazing Nuraghe''s. Love the colours of your shot. vivid and sharp.', '2014-05-29 13:15:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7222199, 1114161, 163430, '<td valign="top">Nice symmetry and powerful patterns.<br/> <br/>Since you opted for color, why didn''t you include the whole flag at the top? It would have been a nice touch. But this doesn''t bother me as much as the fact that the horizon is slightly tilted to the right. Just a bit, but my mind cannot seem to ignore it :-(</td>', 'Nice symmetry and powerful patterns. Since you opted for color, why didn''t you include the whole flag at the top? It would have been a nice touch. But this doesn''t bother me as much as the fact that the horizon is slightly tilted to the right. Just a bit, but my mind cannot seem to ignore it :-(', '2014-05-29 13:27:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7222200, 1114406, 163430, '<td valign="top">Powerful. Symmetry, contrast, depth... Everything works in this image.</td>', 'Powerful. Symmetry, contrast, depth... Everything works in this image.', '2014-05-29 13:29:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7222201, 1114131, 163430, '<td valign="top">Y U no B&amp;W? :-)</td>', 'Y U no B&W? :-)', '2014-05-29 13:32:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7222206, 1114381, 163430, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and nice grass texture.</td>', 'Nice colors and nice grass texture.', '2014-05-29 13:40:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7222211, 1114220, 163430, '<td valign="top">Did you try this in B&amp;W? I would love to see a contrasty, (over)sharpened B&amp;W version of this in the outtakes.</td>', 'Did you try this in B&W? I would love to see a contrasty, (over)sharpened B&W version of this in the outtakes.', '2014-05-29 13:45:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7222212, 1114154, 163430, '<td valign="top">Maybe the framing is just a little bit too tight. Just maybe.</td>', 'Maybe the framing is just a little bit too tight. Just maybe.', '2014-05-29 13:46:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7222221, 1114185, 163430, '<td valign="top">This one has potential. Subject is interesting. Colors and exposure are on the spot, but the image lacks some details in the execution.<br/> <br/>Depth of field - Both deeper and shallower would have been better that this, IMO. The fence is both here and not here.<br/> <br/>Framing - That chimney begs to be included fully in the picture. That roof end was probably unavoidable without loosing the straight-on perspective that i really like in this shot.</td>', 'This one has potential. Subject is interesting. Colors and exposure are on the spot, but the image lacks some details in the execution. Depth of field - Both deeper and shallower would have been better that this, IMO. The fence is both here and not here. Framing - That chimney begs to be included fully in the picture. That roof end was probably unavoidable without loosing the straight-on perspective that i really like in this shot.', '2014-05-29 14:00:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7222229, 1113824, 163430, '<td valign="top">Don''t you mean Microsoft headquarters? :-)</td>', 'Don''t you mean Microsoft headquarters? :-)', '2014-05-29 14:07:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7222231, 1114057, 163430, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. I love the alternate interpretation, the composition, the B&amp;W, the just-right DoF, the soft lighting...</td>', 'Nicely done. I love the alternate interpretation, the composition, the B&W, the just-right DoF, the soft lighting...', '2014-05-29 14:08:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7222235, 1114398, 163430, '<td valign="top">This one doesn''t work for me :-(<br/>The blur, the crop, the subject... Maybe it''s me, but i don''t get it :-(</td>', 'This one doesn''t work for me :-(The blur, the crop, the subject... Maybe it''s me, but i don''t get it :-(', '2014-05-29 14:10:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7222237, 1114285, 163430, '<td valign="top">Y U no B&amp;W? :-)<br/>I think it would work even better.</td>', 'Y U no B&W? :-)I think it would work even better.', '2014-05-29 14:12:03.000000', NULL, 1),
