(7222317, 1114113, 175946, '<td valign="top">Nice presentation of old and new.</td>', 'Nice presentation of old and new.', '2014-05-29 18:11:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7222321, 1113486, 92577, '<td valign="top">loving this</td>', 'loving this', '2014-05-29 18:29:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7222777, 1114269, 163430, '<td valign="top">Very nice idea, excellent colors and exposure.<br/> <br/>The tilted horizon bothers me a lot. Too bad this challenge was minimal editing.<br/> <br/>Another thing that minimal editing forbids you to correct in post is cropping and framing issues. I have no idea whether the location and equipment allowed you to produce a tighter crop with little less sky, without that far left lamppost. Maybe even sacrifice the far right building (not the yellow glass one, the one further to the right) in order to exclude more of the sky which, apart from the beautiful deep blue color, is uninteresting. No clouds, no stars, no moon...<br/>Again, i don''t know the location and the equipment you have. Maybe the sky is really more interesting than the foreground you opted to crop out of the frame. <br/> <br/>Either way, too bad this challenge was minimal editing.</td>', 'Very nice idea, excellent colors and exposure. The tilted horizon bothers me a lot. Too bad this challenge was minimal editing. Another thing that minimal editing forbids you to correct in post is cropping and framing issues. I have no idea whether the location and equipment allowed you to produce a tighter crop with little less sky, without that far left lamppost. Maybe even sacrifice the far right building (not the yellow glass one, the one further to the right) in order to exclude more of the sky which, apart from the beautiful deep blue color, is uninteresting. No clouds, no stars, no moon...Again, i don''t know the location and the equipment you have. Maybe the sky is really more interesting than the foreground you opted to crop out of the frame.  Either way, too bad this challenge was minimal editing.', '2014-05-30 13:55:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7222778, 1114075, 163430, '<td valign="top">When i look at this image, my head tilts to the left on reflex :-(<br/>Other than that, it''s a very, very good picture.</td>', 'When i look at this image, my head tilts to the left on reflex :-(Other than that, it''s a very, very good picture.', '2014-05-30 13:56:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7222779, 1114049, 163430, '<td valign="top">Nice. The sky, the reflections, the angle, the depth... <br/>I would have preferred a bit more exposure (no more that +1EV), but that would have blown up the clouds too much. Too bad this challenge is minimal editing and these things are not fixable in post.</td>', 'Nice. The sky, the reflections, the angle, the depth... I would have preferred a bit more exposure (no more that +1EV), but that would have blown up the clouds too much. Too bad this challenge is minimal editing and these things are not fixable in post.', '2014-05-30 14:00:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7222920, 1114308, 150277, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shapes and lighting.  My favorite of the challenge.</td>', 'Wonderful shapes and lighting.  My favorite of the challenge.', '2014-05-31 09:48:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7222921, 1114362, 150277, '<td valign="top">I love the pattern on the building, and green lights, how unique.  Great find. I wonder what the image would have looked like without that lowest (less interesting to me) level.</td>', 'I love the pattern on the building, and green lights, how unique.  Great find. I wonder what the image would have looked like without that lowest (less interesting to me) level.', '2014-05-31 09:51:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7222923, 1114161, 150277, '<td valign="top">I really like this image.  Great composition/choice for filling the frame.  I think the gray sky is perfect for a bridge in NY.</td>', 'I really like this image.  Great composition/choice for filling the frame.  I think the gray sky is perfect for a bridge in NY.', '2014-05-31 09:55:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7222928, 1113738, 20364, '<td valign="top">I love the grunge here and the texture - nice work 8</td>', 'I love the grunge here and the texture - nice work 8', '2014-05-31 10:28:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7222929, 1114372, 20364, '<td valign="top">For minimal editing, this is a great photo. I only wonder what it might have looked like without the cloud on the left over the top of the building. Nice photo - I gave it an 8.</td>', 'For minimal editing, this is a great photo. I only wonder what it might have looked like without the cloud on the left over the top of the building. Nice photo - I gave it an 8.', '2014-05-31 10:29:57.000000', NULL, 1),
